sequenceDiagram
    actor Usuario as Usuario
    participant Browser as Navegador
    participant DNS as Cloudflare DNS
    participant Tunnel as Cloudflare Tunnel
    participant Caddy as Caddy Server
    participant App as Aplicacion SvelteKit
    participant Umami as Umami Analytics
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Usuario,DB: Flujo de una peticion HTTP completa

    Usuario->>Browser: Visita tudominio.com
    Browser->>DNS: Resolver tudominio.com
    DNS-->>Browser: IP del Cloudflare Tunnel

    Note over Browser,Tunnel: Conexion HTTPS cifrada

    Browser->>Tunnel: GET / (HTTPS)
    Tunnel->>Caddy: Reenviar via tunnel cifrado

    Note over Caddy: Caddy termina SSL/TLS<br/>y enruta segun dominio

    Caddy->>App: GET / (HTTP localhost:3002)
    App->>App: Renderizar pagina SvelteKit
    App-->>Caddy: HTML + CSS + JS
    Caddy-->>Tunnel: Respuesta con headers
    Tunnel-->>Browser: Respuesta HTTPS
    Browser-->>Usuario: Mostrar pagina

    Note over Browser,Umami: Tracking de analiticas

    Browser->>Browser: Ejecutar umami.js
    Browser->>Tunnel: POST /api/collect<br/>(evento de pageview)
    Tunnel->>Caddy: Reenviar a analytics.tudominio.com
    Caddy->>Umami: POST /api/collect
    Umami->>DB: INSERT evento
    DB-->>Umami: OK
    Umami-->>Caddy: 200 OK
    Caddy-->>Tunnel: 200 OK
    Tunnel-->>Browser: 200 OK

    Note over Usuario,DB: Usuario navega la app sin rastreo invasivo
